<view class="page"><view class="heading">投诉与协调</view><view class="sub">运营人员将结合订单、证据与双方说明协调处理。</view><view wx:if="orderId" class="card"><view class="note">正在提交此订单的投诉。结算前的待处理纠纷暂停结算；结算已发起或已完成时，由运营人员人工协调。</view><textarea class="input textarea" value="{{content}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000" placeholder="描述问题、沟通情况及希望的处理方式"/><view class="evidence"><image wx:for="{{evidence}}" wx:key="id" src="{{item.preview}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:if="evidence.length<6" bindtap="image">＋ 证据</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||!content}}">提交投诉</button></view><view class="label">我的投诉记录</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><text class="time">{{item.time}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="note">{{item.content}}</view><view class="proof-note" wx:if="item.resolution">处理结果：{{item.resolution}}</view></view><view wx:if="!items.length" class="empty">暂无投诉记录<text>
</text>需提交投诉时，请从具体订单进入</view></view>
